# 行尾统一为 LF，避免 Windows 下 checkout 后整文件"被修改"
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做行尾转换
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary

# HTML / CSS / JS / JSON / TOML 明确按文本处理
*.html text
*.css text
*.js text
*.json text
*.toml text
*.md text
